      "minDuration": 11,
      "narration": "To add like fractions, add the numerators and keep the common denominator. 4 by 9 plus 2 by 9 is 4 plus 2, which is 6, over 9. 6 by 9 in its simplest form is 2 by 3.",
      "captions": "Sum of like fractions = (Sum of their numerators) / (Common denominator). 4/9 + 2/9 = (4 + 2)/9 = 6/9 = 2/3."
