      "minDuration": 11,
      "narration": "Now 3 by 8 plus 1 by 8 plus 5 by 8. That is 3 plus 1 plus 5, which is 9, over 8. 9 by 8 is one whole and 1 by 8 more, so the sum is 1 and 1 by 8.",
