      "minDuration": 15,
      "narration": "For mixed fractions, change them into improper fractions first. 2 and 4 by 5 is 14 by 5. 1 and 3 by 10 is 13 by 10. 3 and 1 by 15 is 46 by 15. The LCM of 5, 10 and 15 is 30. So we get 84 plus 39 plus 92, which is 215, over 30. That is 43 by 6, or 7 and 1 by 6.",
